{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br> <strong>Ghost Janitors</strong> is a 1-4 player co-op horror game where you and your friends clean haunted locations. What starts as a simple job quickly turns into a terrifying fight against eerie ghosts and dark secrets. Stay brave, work together, and scrub away the supernatural\u2014<strong>if you dare</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772990/extras/TASKS.png?t=1739283716\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just do your job. Clean up the house with your team, get out and get rewarded for each task you complete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772990/extras/newCleaning.gif?t=1739283716\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772990/extras/STAYINTHELIGHT.png?t=1739283716\" />Remember, keep the generator and lights on all the time and stay in the light. We're pretty sure nothing bad is in the shadows, but <strong>it's better to be safe</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772990/extras/newGenerator.gif?t=1739283716\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772990/extras/RANDOMIZED_AI.png?t=1739283716\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every playthrough has a unique experience; Ghost Janitors introduces randomized AI, tasks, sounds, jumpscares, and more, delivering dynamic and <strong>unpredictable gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772990/extras/newJumpscare.gif?t=1739283716\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772990/extras/PROGRESSION-new.png?t=1739283716\" />Dedication pays off, as the game rewards your progress with unlockable content. Discover new maps with captivating backstories, advanced equipment to enhance your cleaning efficiency, and a range of cosmetics to personalize your character..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772990/extras/newProgresion.gif?t=1739283716\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772990/extras/FEATURES.png?t=1739283716\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ghost Janitors boasts impressive graphics, heart-stopping jumpscares, and immersive 3D audio, creating a truly chilling atmosphere. Engage in proximity voice chat to share the terror with your friends in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772990/extras/newFeatures.gif?t=1739283716\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you're seeking a horror game that combines thrills and entertainment, <strong>Ghost Janitors is a must-play</strong>. Gather your team, equip yourselves, and let's conquer the haunted challenge together!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"It's just the beginning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2772990/5f0aa0a82adacb12503cee8cfa8c15116f695089.jpg"},{"name":"Crimsonwood House","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2772990/f59eed816ee677741e38a6a8acae5a62bb2912f3.jpg"},{"name":"Ravenwood Manor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2772990/d393ffbc14e12f059c6fc17d764f3c1e875842f0.jpg"},{"name":"City Lights Villa","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2772990/627ade1c820c9ef755a0fa14525a44170ad9de97.jpg"},{"name":"Oh no...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2772990/92bc04627368746fe03fb0ee672f4425d3a101bf.jpg"},{"name":"Novice Cleaner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2772990/3ab09f0e21f29a41580a62d6dd5a085ffa160afa.jpg"},{"name":"Advanced Cleaner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2772990/23a45e1b60821f57b3e9e15f2bf31a997bb7b5a8.jpg"},{"name":"Expert Cleaner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2772990/72bc008f427368df03d71e01fab03485a7ce5242.jpg"},{"name":"You are good at... Dying...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2772990/80cf89f71fbe6e5ab9eaeaf77e5a37d4aaa79c0e.jpg"},{"name":"Dying Expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2772990/17e6dc722d8afed4f2a7272a67d3bc814a135102.jpg"}],"total":21},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2772990?t=1739283716","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772990/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1739283716","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772990/8f9734c62e1ba5de6a2e27efd1b7d34bc7c4b6b0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1739283716","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772990/8f9734c62e1ba5de6a2e27efd1b7d34bc7c4b6b0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1739283716","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids